OL,3,ACalifornia governor commutes death
OL,4,Asentences for all 548 people on death
OL,5,Arow
OL,6,
OL,7,FCalifornia Governor Gavin Newsom has
OL,8,Fcommuted the death sentences of all 548
OL,9,Fpeople on death row in the state,
OL,10,Fchanging them instead with life in
OL,11,Fprison.
OL,13,F"We can now let these offenders die in
OL,14,Fobscurity while we forever remember and
OL,15,Fhonour the victims," he said in a
OL,16,Fletter.
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,314,300,200,140,0,100
